# Lab 5 reference headers

Updated November 4, 2026.

`ArducamLink.h` defines the original camera-link commands and interface;
`ArducamUart.h` maps the lab serial operations onto Arduino Serial.
Their original implementations and Arducam library remain reference material.

This is the original Lab 5 reference project, not the completed GCS KFS1
file/camera service. Application and vendor sources are preserved. Use
[Lab 8](../../Astro331_Lab8_Code/README.md) for the final firmware, GPIO27/baud
environments, upload/download, camera capture and preview support.
